	(text "R30 and C30: 1 / (2 pi x 270 x 33 nF) = 17.9 kHz,\nthe low-pass of audio.md. GPIO 18 at ALT5 is the\nPWM pin of the Pi Zero. A Pi 1 to 3 has PWM only on\nits analogue jack: a short cable brings it to J10."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 116.84 0)
